### Distributed Job Scheduler - Phase 1 API Examples
### Can be executed using IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client or VS Code REST Client plugin.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@jobId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. Submit Job - Success (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobType": "SEND_EMAIL",
  "payload": "{\"to\":\"user@example.com\",\"template\":\"WELCOME_EMAIL\",\"userId\":1001}",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "idempotencyKey": "IDEM-EMAIL-2026-001"
}

###

### 2. Submit Job - Duplicate Idempotency Key (409 Conflict)
# Re-submitting the exact same idempotencyKey should trigger 409 Conflict.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobType": "SEND_EMAIL",
  "payload": "{\"to\":\"user@example.com\",\"template\":\"WELCOME_EMAIL\",\"userId\":1001}",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "idempotencyKey": "IDEM-EMAIL-2026-001"
}

###

### 3. Submit Job - Request Body Validation Error (400 Bad Request)
# Fails validation due to blank jobType and past scheduledAt timestamp.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobType": "",
  "payload": "",
  "scheduledAt": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "idempotencyKey": ""
}

###

### 4. Get Job Details by ID - Success (200 OK)
# Replace {{jobId}} with a valid UUID returned from POST /api/v1/jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Get Job Details by ID - Not Found (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. List Jobs - Default Pagination (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. List Jobs - With Status Filter & Pagination Parameters (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs?status=PENDING&page=0&size=10&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=DESC
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. List Jobs - Invalid Sort Field (400 Bad Request)
# Fails validation because 'invalidField' is not in the allowed sortBy list.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs?sortBy=invalidField
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. List Jobs - Excessive Page Size Boundary Error (400 Bad Request)
# Fails validation because size=150 exceeds the maximum allowed page size (100).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs?size=150
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. List Jobs - Invalid Sort Order (400 Bad Request)
# Fails validation because sortOrder must be either ASC or DESC.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs?sortOrder=INVALID
Accept: application/json
